troparion.text:
In their sufferings, Thy martyrs O Lord,
received imperishable crowns from Thee, our God;
for, possessed of Thy might,
they set at naught the tormenters
and crushed the feeble audacity of the demons.//
Through their supplications save Thou our souls.

